{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>You may not slaughter the pesaḥ.</b> By the same logic, the same applies to the rest of the sacrifices — but since it is written 'בכל מושבותיכם תאכלו מצות' (in all your dwellings you shall eat matzot), one might say the same applies to the pesaḥ as well; therefore Scripture says 'לא תוכל לזבח את הפסח.' Another interpretation: even though it already warned concerning similar matters, Scripture repeated it, lest you say: since all of it is eaten by strangers, its slaughter may be anywhere — it comes to teach otherwise."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:52:59.594596306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}